      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TILLY GIRL (6) made light work of the tricky draw with a fast early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (20.05) at Traralgon over 350m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can find winning form. SUPREME QUEEN (7) hit the ground running from an outside draw with a fast early split, holding on for a minor placing when second and beaten one length at this track over 400m in 22.96. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to feature. HEAD OF STAFF (1) was a little disappointing last start at Traralgon when 4th (24.30) over 425m. Great record here at the trip having never missed the frame including one win. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to her credit. Has the ability to give this a shake. URBAN BITES (2) can measure up with the right run.",
